"parts":[{"text":"ஒள்","lemma":"ஒள்","gloss":"bright"}],"gloss":"bright"},{"surface":"நுதல்","parts":[{"text":"நுதல்","lemma":"நுதல்","gloss":"forehead"}],"gloss":"forehead"},{"surface":"அரிவை","parts":[{"text":"அரிவை","lemma":"அரிவை","gloss":"young woman"}],"gloss":"young woman"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புனல்தரு","parts":[{"text":"புனல்தரு","lemma":"புனல்தரு","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பசுங்காய்","parts":[{"text":"பசுங்காய்","lemma":"பசுங்காய்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தின்றதன்","parts":[{"text":"தின்றதன்","lemma":"தின்றதன்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தப்பற்","parts":[{"text":"தப்பற்","lemma":"தப்பற்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"கொன்பதிற்","parts":[{"text":"கொன்பதிற்","lemma":"கொன்பதிற்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"றொன்பது","parts":[{"text":"றொன்பது","lemma":"றொன்பது","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"களிற்றொ","parts":[{"text":"களிற்றொ","lemma":"களிற்றொ","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"டவணிறை","parts":[{"text":"டவணிறை","lemma":"டவணிறை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"பொன்","parts":[{"text":"பொன்","lemma":"பொன்","gloss":"gold"}],"gloss":"gold"},{"surface":"செய்","parts":[{"text":"செய்","lemma":"செய்தல்","gloss":"made"}],"gloss":"made"},{"surface":"பாவை","parts":[{"text":"பாவை","lemma":"பாவை","gloss":"doll"}],"gloss":"doll"},{"surface":"கொடுப்பவும்","parts":[{"text":"கொடுப்பவும்","lemma":"கொடுத்தல்","gloss":"even when giving"}],"gloss":"even when giving"},{"surface":"கொள்ளான்","parts":[{"text":"கொள்ளான்","lemma":"கொள்ளுதல்","gloss":"he did not accept"}],"gloss":"he did not accept"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பெண்","parts":[{"text":"பெண்","lemma":"பெண்","gloss":"woman"}],"gloss":"woman"},{"surface":"கொலை","parts":[{"text":"கொலை","lemma":"கொலை","gloss":"killing"}],"gloss":"killing"},{"surface":"புரிந்த","parts":[{"text":"புரிந்த","lemma":"புரிதல்","gloss":"who did"}],"gloss":"who did"},{"surface":"நன்னன்","parts":[{"text":"நன்னன்","lemma":"நன்னன்","gloss":"Nannan"}],"gloss":"Nannan"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"போல","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வரையா","parts":[{"text":"வரையா","lemma":"வரையறுத்தல்","gloss":"limitless"}],"gloss":"limitless"},{"surface":"நிரையத்து","parts":[{"text":"நிரையத்து","lemma":"நிரையத்து","gloss":"into hell"}],"gloss":"into hell"},{"surface":"செலீஇயரோ","parts":[{"text":"செலீஇயரோ","lemma":"செல்லுதல்","gloss":"may she go"}],"gloss":"may she go"},{"surface":"அன்னை","parts":[{"text":"அன்னை","lemma":"அன்னை","gloss":"mother"}],"gloss":"mother"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஒரு","parts":[{"text":"ஒரு","lemma":"ஒரு","gloss":"one"}],"gloss":"one"},{"surface":"நாள்","parts":[{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"நாள்","gloss":"day"}],"gloss":"day"},{"surface":"நகை","parts":[{"text":"நகை","lemma":"நகை","gloss":"smiling"}],"gloss":"smiling"},{"surface":"முக","parts":[{"text":"முக","lemma":"முகம்","gloss":"face"}],"gloss":"face"},{"surface":"விருந்தினன்","parts":[{"text":"விருந்தினன்","lemma":"விருந்தினன்","gloss":"guest"}],"gloss":"guest"},{"surface":"வந்து","parts":[{"text":"வந்து","lemma":"வருதல்","gloss":"having come"}],"gloss":"having come"},{"surface":"என","parts":[{"text":"என","lemma":"என","gloss":"because"}],"gloss":"because"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பகை","parts":[{"text":"பகை","lemma":"பகை","gloss":"hostile"}],"gloss":"hostile"},{"surface":"முக","parts":[{"text":"முக","lemma":"முகம்","gloss":"face"}],"gloss":"face"},{"surface":"ஊரின்","parts":[{"text":"ஊரின்","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"like the town"}],"gloss":"like the town"},{"surface":"துஞ்சல்","parts":[{"text":"துஞ்சல்","lemma":"துஞ்சுதல்","gloss":"sleeping"}],"gloss":"sleeping"},{"surface":"ஓ","parts":[{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"indeed"},{"surface":"இலளே","parts":[{"text":"இலளே","lemma":"இலள்","gloss":"she does not have"}],"gloss":"she does not have"}]}],"literal":"Having bathed, who went, the bright-foreheaded young woman / for the mistake of eating a green fruit brought by the water / eighty-one male elephants with her weight / in gold-made statue even when giving, not accepting / like Nannan who committed the killing of a woman / may mother go to the limitless hell! / Because a smiling-faced guest came for one day / like a hostile-faced town, she does not sleep at all!","translation":"May mother go to the boundless hell, just like Nannan who committed the murder of a young woman! He refused to accept eighty-one male elephants and a gold statue of her weight offered in compensation for the mistake of eating a green fruit brought by the stream when she went to bathe. Because a smiling-faced guest came for just one day, mother does not sleep at all, watching like a hostile town!","modern":"நீராடச் சென்ற ஒளிபொருந்திய நெற்றியையுடைய ஒரு பெண், ஆற்று நீர் அடித்துக்கொண்டு வந்த பச்சைக் காயைத் தின்ற குற்றத்திற்காக, அவளது எடைக்கு நிகரான பொன்னால் செய்த பாவையையும் எண்பத்தொரு ஆண் யானைகளையும் இழப்பீடாகத் தந்தபோதும் ஏற்றுக்கொள்ளாமல், அந்தப் பெண்ணைக் கொலை செய்த நன்னனைப் போல, அன்னை எல்லையற்ற நரகத்திற்குச் செல்வாளாக! ஒருநாள் புன்னகை முகத்தோடு விருந்தினராகத் தலைவன் வந்தான் என்பதற்காக, பகைமை கொண்ட ஊரைப் போல அன்னை சிறிதும் உறங்காமல் விழித்திருக்கிறாளே!","explanation":"The friend (tōḻi) speaks to herself or to the heroine (talaivi) in frustration about the mother's strict vigilance. The mother has become extremely watchful and sleepless ever since the hero visited them as a guest for a single day, preventing any secret meetings between the lovers. The friend compares the mother's cruelty to the historical king Nannan, who executed a young girl for eating a green mango that floated down a river from his orchard, refusing all gold and elephant compensations offered by her family. By wishing that the mother go to the limitless hell just like Nannan, the friend expresses her deep anger at the mother's relentless guarding. This poem belongs to the Kuriñci tiṇai, depicting the obstacles faced by the lovers during their secret courtship.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}